{"unit_id":"uigdwunm__dsh-process-fold#card-zh","repo":"uigdwunm/dsh-process-fold","commit":"b9aa91c652fcef3db443de462c742404b3754e2a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-process-fold 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的界面插件，会把对话中的思考、工具调用和上下文项目整理成带边框的过程框，并以模型文本为分界。折叠时每框保留最新两项，点击堆叠线可单独展开，点击上边缘可收回；每轮开关则可统一切换该轮全部过程。官方过程按钮存在时沿用该按钮，不存在时显示替代开关。用户消息、交互提问、错误提示和模型文本保持在框外。适合希望压缩长会话过程、同时保留逐项查看能力的 DSH Web 用户；不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.ts:240-276","src/client.ts:290-363","src/client.ts:524-560"]}
{"unit_id":"uigdwunm__dsh-process-fold#card-en","repo":"uigdwunm/dsh-process-fold","commit":"b9aa91c652fcef3db443de462c742404b3754e2a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-process-fold folds DSH Web process items into bordered groups, showing the latest two. Click a stack to open a group or its top edge to close it. A turn control toggles all groups. User messages, questions, errors, and model text stay outside. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.ts:240-276","src/client.ts:290-363","src/client.ts:524-560"]}
